  "description": "The Groadinger UG is being retired as we evolve our frame lineup for 2026.This is the final production run, and the remaining UG26 frames are already in paint with a 4-week turnaround.\n\nOur ultimate adventure-gravel machine, the UG has defined Stayer’s mixed-terrain ethos for years — fast off-road, planted on descents, and ready for big-day exploring.Once this final batch is gone, the UG is gone for good.\n\nUpdate 11/5/26 – the last Medium is currently reserved (so marked as sold out, but itsn’t quite yet).\n\nThe Stayer Groadinger UG26 frame is the ultimate adventure gravel bike, built for fast off-roadin’ and adventure-groading. Designed for riders who crave versatility, this lightweight steel frame balances road, gravel, and gnar — perfect for UK terrain and for anyone seeking a do-it-all gnar-steed.\n\nAdditionally, it supports 650b or 700c wheelsets, 1x or 2x drivetrains and works with either carbon or steel forks — perfect for packing up, packing light, but never packing in.\n\nNow featuring Happy Hugger cable guides and modular dropouts with UDH compatibility.\n\nThe new UG26 modular dropouts. These showing the standard 142x12mm inserts.\n\nHappy Hugger cable guides on the bottom of the UG26 chainstays, made in collaboration with Hulsroy.",
